### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentId":"S1","email":"a@b.com","password":"password123","fullName":"Test User","facultyId":9}

### Login (saves the token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"a@b.com","password":"password123"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### All listings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listings

### Filtered listings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listings?facultyId=9&condition=GOOD&minPrice=10&maxPrice=20&sort=price_asc

### One listing
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listings/1

### Create listing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"title":"Physics notes","description":"Printed, 2024","price":5.50,"facultyId":9,"categoryId":1,"itemCondition":"GOOD","imageUrls":["https://labntnnhhqhifdpyrtyi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/item-photos/1792136499021-6eca0cjztcm.jpg"]}

### Delete listing (use a real id)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/listings/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Me
GET http://localhost:8080/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}